abstract = {S2 TL;DR: This work introduces the Eye Fairness dataset with 30,000 subjects (Harvard-EF) covering three major eye diseases including age-related macular degeneration, diabetic retinopathy, and glaucoma affecting 380 million patients globally and proposes a fair identity scaling (FIS) approach combining group and individual scaling together to improve model fairness.},
